1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:10,317
Meet Dalil: an AI shopping agent that finds the best deal, negotiates for you, and pays with PayPal, with guardrails the AI can't bypass.

2
00:00:11,118 --> 00:00:12,938
I just ask in plain English.

3
00:00:12,938 --> 00:00:17,945
Dalil searches a live product catalog and the web, then compares real offers.

4
00:00:17,945 --> 00:00:24,578
Every price is signed by the server, so the AI can't make one up, and every store gets a trust rating.

5
00:00:24,578 --> 00:00:29,325
It even reads the price history and tells me whether to buy now, or wait.

6
00:00:30,325 --> 00:00:31,926
Now, a spending limit.

7
00:00:31,926 --> 00:00:34,328
I set my maximum to five dollars.

8
00:00:34,328 --> 00:00:41,169
The AI still proposes the purchase, but the server enforces my mandate and blocks the payment.

9
00:00:41,169 --> 00:00:42,916
My rules beat the model.

10
00:00:43,916 --> 00:00:48,916
Next, Dalil negotiates agent to agent with the store's own seller agent.

11
00:00:48,916 --> 00:00:53,708
It asks for a better deal, and comes back with a lower, signed price.

12
00:00:53,708 --> 00:00:55,305
No haggling on my side.

13
00:00:56,305 --> 00:01:01,821
When I'm ready, I approve with PayPal, on the real PayPal checkout, here in the sandbox.

14
00:01:01,821 --> 00:01:07,900
Dalil authorizes first, so the money is only held, not taken, and I get a short window to cancel.

15
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:14,356
Then the payment is captured, and I get a trust receipt showing exactly what was checked before I paid.

16
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:24,438
For fourteen days after I buy, Dalil keeps watching the price.

17
00:01:24,438 --> 00:01:29,855
If it drops, I automatically get the difference back as a partial PayPal refund.

18
00:01:29,855 --> 00:01:32,361
A real refund, with no forms to fill.

19
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,239
Not ready to buy yet?

20
00:01:36,239 --> 00:01:39,664
I set a target price, and Dalil watches it for me.

21
00:01:39,664 --> 00:01:42,610
The moment the price drops, I get an alert.

22
00:01:46,594 --> 00:01:48,762
Shopping from more than one store?

23
00:01:48,762 --> 00:01:54,180
Dalil builds a multi-store cart and pays every store with one single PayPal approval.

24
00:01:54,180 --> 00:02:01,510
Each store is tracked on its own, so if I change my mind about one, I cancel just that store and get a full refund.

25
00:02:08,175 --> 00:02:10,121
Sometimes, someone else pays.

26
00:02:10,121 --> 00:02:13,209
With family approval, I send a link to my mom.

27
00:02:13,209 --> 00:02:21,262
She sees exactly what I'm buying, approves on her own phone, and pays from her own PayPal account, within a limit I set.

28
00:02:30,628 --> 00:02:32,040
Buying with friends?

29
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:34,227
One group link splits the cost.

30
00:02:34,227 --> 00:02:38,178
And every dollar Dalil saves me is tracked in one place.

31
00:02:42,575 --> 00:02:43,095
Dalil.

32
00:02:43,095 --> 00:02:48,464
An AI that shops like an expert, and pays with PayPal, safely.

33
00:02:48,464 --> 00:02:50,543
Try the live demo today.
